 "name_en": "Contract Price Renegotiation (6AN)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Contract Price Renegotiation (6AN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofc2f48bc8b9247c380c76470d6a4f1ed\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2f48bc8b9247c380c76470d6a4f1ed__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Enable strategic buyers and commodity managers to do the following based on seamless integration of the strategic buyer application built on <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> with SAP Business Technology Platform (SAP BTP):</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Achieve savings targets through a fully integrated price renegotiation process flow for central contract items</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Select multiple items from multiple contracts for price renegotiation and capture them in a dedicated project</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Monitor the bidding process once the project is published; suppliers can see the project and start quoting</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Monitor and refer to the approval process for automatic updates of central contracts with final negotiated prices</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2f48bc8b9247c380c76470d6a4f1ed__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Select multiple contract items from different contracts with the same supplier to create contract renegotiation project for price renegotiation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Negotiate prices of existing contract items with the supplier</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Award the agreed price of the contracted items and route through existing contract price update process</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2f48bc8b9247c380c76470d6a4f1ed__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Gain a seamless process and user experience</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve operational efficiency</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase savings for direct spend</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>合同价格重新谈判 (6AN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofc2f48bc8b9247c380c76470d6a4f1ed\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2f48bc8b9247c380c76470d6a4f1ed__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">使战略采购商和商品经理能够基于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 上构建的策略采购商应用程序与 SAP Business Technology Platform (SAP BTP) 的无缝集成执行以下操作：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 通过完全集成的集中合同项目价格重新谈判流程流实现节约目标</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 从价格重新谈判的多个合同中选择多个项目，并在专用项目中捕获</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 项目发布后监控投标流程；供应商可以查看项目并开始报价</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 监控并参考使用最终协商价格自动更新集中合同的审批流程</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2f48bc8b9247c380c76470d6a4f1ed__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">从与同一供应商的不同合同中选择多个合同项目，以创建价格重新谈判的合同重新谈判项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">与供应商协商现有合同项目的价格</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">授标合同项目的约定价格，并通过现有合同价格更新流程进行传送</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2f48bc8b9247c380c76470d6a4f1ed__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">获得无缝的流程和用户体验</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高运营效率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">增加直接支出的节省额</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
